{"c":{"355722":["Xylo Forbartz","Male","b355722-WAcMLaqmY2bO.jpg","The former captain of the Federated Kingdom's Fifth Order of the Holy Knights and the now de facto leader of Penal Hero Unit 9004. He was sentenced to be a hero for the crime of killing the goddess Senerva.",468],"355723":["Venetim Leopool","Male","b355723-N6dEyV3gwMet.png","The commander of the Punisher Heroes Squad 9004. He is a rare conman who attempted to sell off the royal palace to a circus. His eloquence and deception skills make him appear competent at first glance, but in reality he's a weakling with no guts.",121],"355724":["Patausche Kivia","Female","b355724-nxZuNKOq5kMo.jpg","Captain of the 13th Holy Knights. She was originally supposed to make a pact with the Goddess Teoritta. She is a serious and righteous holy knight, but can also be strict and harsh in her words. She is willing to sacrifice her own life and the life of the hero for the Goddess.",482],"355725":["Dotta Luzulas","Male","b355725-2vLrWMLNXytR.png","An unparalleled petty thief, responsible for over a thousand thefts. He impulsively attempts to steal anything, from the Goddess's coffin to completely meaningless objects, and possesses the skill to actually steal anything.",70],"355726":["Teoritta","Female","b355726-dKp210MmTqMS.jpg","The Sword Goddess who made a contract with Xylo. She summons numerous swords, including holy swords and demon swords.",516],"360741":["Tatsuya","Male","b360741-br5UdxTcXq1f.png","A berserker who has been a member of the Hero Squad longer than anyone else. Because he has been resurrected as a hero so many times, he has lost his sense of self and the ability to think, and is unable to speak.",101],"360742":["Norgalle Senridge","Male","b360742-7hfqRRLdq4Zx.png","A terrorist who believed himself to be the true king of the United Kingdom and carried out a large-scale terrorist act against the royal family. Nicknamed \"His Majesty.\" Although he displays an arrogant attitude, his concern for his people is genuine.",147],"370733":["Tsav","Male","b370733-hIA6qSW42SlT.png","A former elite assassin raised by an assassination cult.",83],"375407":["Neely","Female","b375407-1ROaWvWjtluz.png","A female dragon who races alongside Jayce on the battlefield. She possesses vibrant blue scales and can unleash powerful flames from her mouth. Because Jayce is loved by the dragon, she can sometimes become jealous and upset.",14],"375408":["Jayce Patiract","Male","b375408-lOwWlfpHXgG3.png","A dragoon who rides a dragon and soars through the skies as the unit's aerial force. He is also skilled in spearmanship. Not only can he communicate with dragons, but he also has an abnormally endearing disposition.",38],"382390":["Rhyno","Male","b382390-RKSdL4EMPZnJ.jpg","An eccentric who volunteered to become a Hero, he possesses a talent for artillery. He has a polite demeanor and speaks like a saint, but he always wears a suspicious smile.",68],"382391":["Frenci Mastibolt","Female","b382391-MqWJ4Ek9qZGM.png","The daughter of the Mastibolt family, the leader of the Southern Night Demons. Formerly engaged to Xylo, their engagement was annulled when he became a Hero, but she refuses to acknowledge that she broke off her engagement with him.",137],"387953":["Rajit Heathrow","Male","b387953-suMCn8bvdgeo.png","",4],"387954":["Zofflec Ostbiche","Male","b387954-dsmVs5Sj9zhH.png","",0],"387955":["Siena","Female","b387955-ikvgHnqJJVli.png","",4],"387956":["Chouzaikan","Male","b387956-1Nu85ABv4v7p.png","",0],"387957":["Shinkan","Male","default.jpg","",0],"387958":["Seikishidanin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"387959":["Seikishidanin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"387960":["Seikishidanin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"387961":["Seikishidanin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"387962":["Seikishidanin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"387963":["Seikishidanin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"387964":["Seikishidanin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"387965":["Seikishidanin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"387966":["Seikishidanin",null,"default.jpg",""